                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. The Employer will maintain a Listing of all over-graded Employees entitled to grade retention as a result of RIF or reclassification action. Prior to announcing a position vacancy, the Employer will give first consideration to the re-promotion/placement of all over-graded Employees entitled to grade retention as a result of RIF or a reclassification of position, and who meet the full civilian and/or military qualifications of the position.",
            "block_bbox": [
                132,
                422,
                1083,
                564
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    132.0,
                    422.0
                ],
                [
                    1083.0,
                    422.0
                ],
                [
                    1083.0,
                    564.0
                ],
                [
                    132.0,
                    564.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. If the position is of equal or intervening grade and within the commuting area, first consideration will be afforded to those Employees who are fully qualified and within the commuting area. If there is more than one eligible Employee in a saved grade status, all candidates will be referred to the selecting official for consideration before the vacancy is announced for competition.",
            "block_bbox": [
                130,
                588,
                1081,
                729
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    130.0,
                    588.0
                ],
                [
                    1081.0,
                    588.0
                ],
                [
                    1081.0,
                    729.0
                ],
                [
                    130.0,
                    729.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. If the position is not within the commuting area and there are no over-graded Employees within the commuting area, the position will be offered to over-graded Employees outside the commuting area before the position is announced. If the Employee refuses the offer of a position outside the commuting area, grade and pay retention will continue if otherwise eligible.",
            "block_bbox": [
                129,
                755,
                1040,
                896
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    129.0,
                    755.0
                ],
                [
                    1040.0,
                    755.0
                ],
                [
                    1040.0,
                    896.0
                ],
                [
                    129.0,
                    896.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "4. The over-graded Employee's name will be removed from the priority placement roster at the expiration of the two-year retention period.",
